# Pairs with RemovalWinsUnderSkew. A group deletion whose cascade stamps the
# group's entries with the local clock leaves them in place on a lagging silo.
MODULE: GroupDeleteStampedWithLocalClock
TARGET: RemovalWinsUnderSkew
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the group deletion's entry removals are stamped with the local clock
PERTURBS: BeginDeleteGroup

--- FIND
                      stamp |-> [x \in Sets |-> IF x \in inSets THEN RemovalStamp(clock[s], slots[x][OwnGroup]) ELSE 0],
--- REPLACE
                      stamp |-> [x \in Sets |-> IF x \in inSets THEN clock[s] + 1 ELSE 0],
--- END